      "writtenOn": "2020-10-01T00:09:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This may prove difficult. Ideally I would port over the entire modular FSM-driven mechanic from TCPMv2. But validation would be unconstrained, and change would be non-trivial.\n\nI attempted to strike a balance between \"fixing critical defects\" and \"keeping changes as compartmentalized as possible\". Deltas as relatively small. Thus are less likely to introduce major user-unexpected regressions.\n\nProper fix (as cited in submission) is full TCPMv2 port. I will carry over my compliance fixes on ToT.",
