        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-30T18:37:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is MF preferred being ignored? I\u0027d recommend using our updated implementation of these functions in the ToT version of usb_pd_alt_mode_dfp.c.\n\nAlso, don\u0027t leave in commented code; just delete them.",
      "revId": "f0e2ba120baa41398f6db95140aeb8bbc5386200",
